'''Group 1 of the [[1962 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place from 30 May to 7 June 1962. The group consisted of [[Colombia national football team|Colombia]], the [[Soviet Union national football team|Soviet Union]], [[Uruguay national football team|Uruguay]], and [[Yugoslavia national football team|Yugoslavia]].<ref>{{cite web |last1=Stokkermans |first1=Karel |last2=Jarreta |first2=Sergio Henrique |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/62f.html |title=World Cup 1962 (Chile, May 30 – June 17) |website=RSSSF.com |publisher=[[Rec.Sport.Soccer Statistics Foundation]] |date=22 October 1999 |access-date=22 May 2018}}</ref>

