===Soviet Union vs Colombia===
The Soviet team scored three quick goals in the first 11 minutes of the game but then let the Colombians make an impressive comeback in the late second half. In the 68 minute Marcos Coll scored a goal directly from a corner,<ref>[https://www.theguardian.com/football/2018/jun/12/golden-goal-marcos-coll-scores-from-a-corner-for-colombia-v-ussr-1962 Golden Goal: Marcos Coll scores from a corner for Colombia v USSR (1962)]</ref> the first Olympic goal in World Cup history.<ref>[https://www.eltiempo.com/Multimedia/especiales/Colombia-Chile1962/ Primer Mundial de Fútbol de la Selección Colombiana]</ref><ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nh4QeuOVSVw Colombia vs Soviet Union on YouTube]</ref>

